      "uid": "zhcn:f3f070159f5c8ead976239b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙的语气，似乎变得与平时不一样了。\r\n虽说智力水平如往常那般超出常人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d0b58b939cca72391875f0fc5ee1274af2fc254fab12b65c5cab8428119c9f7",
