      "uid": "zhcn:be34ee1b3915f2dc6c4d9cdd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“战斗”并不是理由。\r\n我并非是为了与什么人战斗，\r\n或是继承什么东西而来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e0c7982a9bb2336252d946c639caded109c21aeeff0c2b7feae86c735026af1",
