    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a01a3ab2d3f7a4f970c3eac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要有一个宇宙，能让我们相遇，\r\n他们便满足了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8461ca86c423fee00d304237aa22d9a335601189626316d2b59cea8aefd7ed2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc81c14440417010e8d9c20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "时间在此刻失去了意义。\r\n空间在此地失去了意义。\r\n隔断世界的境界线此时消失不见，万物统一——",
      "source_fingerprint": "deffd1ac546671c26c474ee79024de6a91455fe0e6b8081f58b0f313601a2379",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        69,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/69/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa0223405bb45834f235d279",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105111.json",
      "json_path": [
