    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d538e729fb5cfb55ee638e78",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只有“爱”。\r\n只有爱永恒存在——\r\n也只有爱，能够永恒存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e593683bfac93ac5570a9093ae03cb7b5af0f7d891f22934902ae704dcba51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
